    dcterms:title "OE Method governance — SHACL shapes (one file for the unit)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The SHACL shapes of the OE Method's governance unit as ONE file (BP-D54): the knowledge base, release history and publish-record suites, each a module. A pure union, proved."@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/oemethod-governance/1.0.0> ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.0.0" .

<http://example.org/publish-ceremony/shapes> dcterms:identifier "publish_record" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <http://example.org/oemethod-governance> ;
    rdfs:comment "Module membership added for the package consolidation (BP-D54): every named subject says dcterms:isPartOf its module. No other change."@en,
        """Shapes for the publish-ceremony GateDecision emitted by oe_publish.sh.

Reuses quality:GateDecision / quality:Evidence rather than minting a publication
vocabulary (L-110: do not mint governance structure on a single producer's evidence;
the OE quality TBox already models gate runs). The pub: namespace carries only the
evidence-value predicates that record WHAT WAS MEASURED — it declares no classes.

The shape's purpose is L-95: it makes a publish record that omits or fakes a ceremony
step non-conformant, so the record cannot be a bare claim of compliance."""@en ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/publish-ceremony/shapes/1.0.0> ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/publish-ceremony/shapes/1.0.1> ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.0.1" .

<http://example.org/oepack-release-history> dcterms:created "2026-05-16T00:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator oe-prov:Agent_MethodAuthor ;
    dcterms:identifier "oepack-release-history" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <http://example.org/oemethod-governance> ;
